* ==================================================================
* IBM MQ Cluster Setup Script for Queue Manager: QM1
* Role: FULL REPOSITORY (FR)
* Target Cluster: PAYMENT_CLUS
* ==================================================================

* 1. Configure TCP Listener
DEFINE LISTENER('LISTENER.1414') TRPTYPE(TCP) PORT(1414) CONTROL(QMGR) REPLACE
START LISTENER('LISTENER.1414')

* 2. Designate this Queue Manager as a Full Repository
ALTER QMGR REPOS('PAYMENT_CLUS')

* 3. Cluster-Receiver Channel (CLUSRCVR)
* Allows all cluster members to send cluster information and messages to QM1
DEFINE CHANNEL('TO.QM1') +
       CHLTYPE(CLUSRCVR) +
       TRPTYPE(TCP) +
       CONNAME('localhost(1414)') +
       CLUSTER('PAYMENT_CLUS') +
       DESCR('Cluster receiver channel for QM1') +
       REPLACE

* 4. Initial Cluster-Sender Channel(s) (CLUSSDR)
* Used for initial cluster registration and discovery
DEFINE CHANNEL('TO.QM2') +
       CHLTYPE(CLUSSDR) +
       TRPTYPE(TCP) +
       CONNAME('localhost(1415)') +
       CLUSTER('PAYMENT_CLUS') +
       DESCR('Cluster sender channel to QM2') +
       REPLACE

* 5. Define Cluster Queues
* Workload balancing is enabled using DEFBIND(NOTFIXED)
DEFINE QLOCAL('PAYMENT.REQ') +
       CLUSTER('PAYMENT_CLUS') +
       DEFBIND(NOTFIXED) +
       DESCR('Cluster workload-balanced queue for PAYMENT_CLUS') +
       REPLACE
